        "digest": "Gaussian distributed noise approximation",
        "description": "An approximate 'Box-Muller' gaussian noise distribution. It looks roughly the same as white noise in a spectral view, very slightly different in a <o>scope~</o>. In a histogram one can see the distribution. The point is the gaussian random number distribution.",
